<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Blockchain on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/tags/blockchain/</link><description>Recent content in Blockchain on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 18 Sep 2025 16:48:20 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/tags/blockchain/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Deploy a TRC-20 Token on TRON Nile: Compile, Publish and Verify</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/detrtotrni.html</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Sep 2025 16:48:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/detrtotrni.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This guide demonstrates how to deploy a TRC-20 token contract on the TRON Nile testnet. Use test funds only and verify every wallet request before signing.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="prerequisites"&gt;Prerequisites&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#prerequisites"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;A TRON wallet.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;The &#13;&#10;&lt;a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/ibnejdfjmmkpcnlpebklmnkoeoihofec" title="TronLink browser extension" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#13;&#10; TronLink browser extension&#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Access to &#13;&#10;&lt;a href="https://tronscan.org/" title="TRONSCAN" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#13;&#10; TRONSCAN&#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;&lt;/a&gt; and its Nile testnet pages.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="obtain-test-trx"&gt;Obtain Test TRX&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#obtain-test-trx"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Copy your wallet address from TronLink. Open the &#13;&#10;&lt;a href="https://nileex.io/join/getJoinPage" title="Nile test-coin faucet" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#13;&#10; Nile test-coin faucet&#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;, enter the address under &lt;code&gt;Get 2000 test coins&lt;/code&gt;, and click &lt;code&gt;Obtain&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>